<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Orivia Diamonds</title>
<meta name="description" content="Orivia Diamonds trades natural, untreated rough and polished diamonds sourced directly from licensed mines and artisanal small-scale mining communities across Sub-Saharan Africa, under Kimberley Process certification and full digital traceability.">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=Work+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#16181c;
    --ink-soft:#4a4740;
    --paper:#ede9e1;
    --paper-soft:#cdc6b6;
    --paper-raised:#f6f3ec;
    --laterite:#ad5230;
    --laterite-soft:#c98257;
    --facet:#6c7a7a;
    --facet-soft:#c9d3d3;
    --rule:rgba(22,24,28,0.14);
    --shadow:rgba(22,24,28,0.08);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
      --ink:#efe9de;
      --ink-soft:#b9b2a4;
      --paper:#15171b;
      --paper-soft:#3a3833;
      --paper-raised:#1c1e23;
      --laterite:#d98257;
      --laterite-soft:#ad5230;
      --facet:#9fb0b0;
      --facet-soft:#2b3433;
      --rule:rgba(239,233,222,0.14);
      --shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"]{
    --ink:#efe9de;
    --ink-soft:#b9b2a4;
    --paper:#15171b;
    --paper-soft:#3a3833;
    --paper-raised:#1c1e23;
    --laterite:#d98257;
    --laterite-soft:#ad5230;
    --facet:#9fb0b0;
    --facet-soft:#2b3433;
    --rule:rgba(239,233,222,0.14);
    --shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Work Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  .label{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    font-size:0.68rem;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--laterite);
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
    font-weight:500;
    margin:0;
    text-wrap:balance;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,56px);}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
    background:var(--paper);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  nav .wrap{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    height:72px;
  }
  .brandmark{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:1.18rem;letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  nav ul{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:34px;margin:0;padding:0;}
  nav ul a{
    font-size:0.86rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);
    transition:color .15s ease;
  }
  nav ul a:hover,nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--laterite);}
  .navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .navlinks ul{display:none;} }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:11px 20px;border-radius:2px;text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);background:none;appearance:none;cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-solid{background:var(--laterite);border-color:var(--laterite);color:var(--paper-raised);}
  .btn-solid:hover{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:40px;
    align-items:center;
    padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,88px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,7vw,88px);
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .hero-art{order:-1;} }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5.2vw,4.1rem);
    line-height:1.02;
    font-optical-sizing:auto;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic;color:var(--laterite);
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .hero-eyebrow .rule{width:30px;height:1px;background:var(--laterite);}
  .hero p.lede{
    margin-top:22px;max-width:46ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.07rem;
  }
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-art{
    display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;
    background:var(--paper-raised);border-radius:28px;padding:24px;
  }
  .hero-art img{width:100%;max-width:320px;height:auto;display:block;}

  /* ---------- STANDARDS STRIP ---------- */
  .ledger{
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
    background:var(--paper-raised);
  }
  .ledger .wrap{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  }
  .ledger-item{
    padding:26px clamp(16px,2.4vw,30px);
    border-right:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .ledger-item:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .ledger-item .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--laterite);}
  .ledger-item h3{font-size:0.98rem;margin-top:10px;font-weight:500;}
  .ledger-item p{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:0.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .ledger .wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:520px){ .ledger .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .ledger-item{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);} .ledger-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;} }

  /* ---------- SECTION SHELL ---------- */
  section{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0;}
  .section-head{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:30px;
    margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);}
  .section-head .label{white-space:nowrap;}
  .section-intro{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:62ch;font-size:1rem;margin:-20px 0 40px;}

  /* ---------- CATALOGUE (rough / polished) ---------- */
  .catalogue{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .catalogue{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .cat-card{background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);}
  .cat-card .label{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .cat-card h3{font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .cat-card > p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:0.95rem;max-width:40ch;margin-bottom:26px;}
  .spec{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
    padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size:0.88rem;
  }
  .spec:first-of-type{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);}
  .spec dt{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .spec dd{margin:0;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.82rem;text-align:right;}
  dl.spec-list{margin:0 0 24px;}
  .cat-art{height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .cat-art svg{height:100%;}

  /* ---------- ORIGIN / CHAIN OF CUSTODY ---------- */
  .origin{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}
  .origin .label{color:var(--laterite-soft);}
  .origin .section-head h2{color:var(--paper);}
  .origin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(30px,5vw,70px);align-items:start;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .origin-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .origin-copy p{color:rgba(239,233,222,0.72);max-width:44ch;font-size:0.98rem;}
  .chain{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;counter-reset:step;}
  .chain li{
    counter-increment:step;
    position:relative;padding:20px 0 20px 54px;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(239,233,222,0.15);
  }
  .chain li:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .chain li::before{
    content:counter(step,decimal-leading-zero);
    position:absolute;left:0;top:19px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--laterite-soft);
  }
  .chain h4{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--paper);}
  .chain p{margin:0;font-size:0.88rem;color:rgba(239,233,222,0.62);max-width:48ch;}
  .aside{
    font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;
    font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--paper) !important;
    max-width:36ch !important;
    padding-left:20px;border-left:2px solid var(--laterite-soft);
    margin-top:30px !important;
  }
  .aside em{color:var(--laterite-soft);font-style:italic;}

  /* ---------- 4Cs ---------- */
  .grading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .grading{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  .grade-card{background:var(--paper);padding:26px 22px;}
  .grade-card .letter{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:2.3rem;color:var(--laterite);line-height:1;
  }
  .grade-card h4{margin:14px 0 6px;font-size:0.96rem;}
  .grade-card p{margin:0;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
  .cta{
    background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--rule);
    padding:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .cta h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .cta p{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:42ch;}
  .cta-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
  .cta-form input,.cta-form select,.cta-form textarea{
    font-family:'Work Sans',sans-serif;font-size:0.9rem;
    padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--paper-soft);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    border-radius:2px;
  }
  .cta-form textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:72px;}
  .cta-form input:focus,.cta-form select:focus,.cta-form textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--laterite);outline-offset:1px;}

  /* ---------- PARCEL MODAL ---------- */
  dialog#parcel-modal{
    border:none;border-radius:3px;padding:0;
    background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink);
    max-width:440px;width:90vw;
    box-shadow:0 24px 64px var(--shadow);
  }
  dialog#parcel-modal::backdrop{background:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);}
  .modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:26px 26px 0;}
  .modal-head .label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .modal-head h3{font-size:1.5rem;}
  .close-x{
    background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;
    padding:4px;flex:none;
  }
  .close-x:hover{color:var(--laterite);}
  .modal-body{padding:16px 26px 26px;}
  .modal-body .spec-list{margin:16px 0 24px;}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:46px 0 36px;}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  footer .label{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;}
  footer p{margin:0;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:38ch;}
  .foot-links{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .foot-links a{font-size:0.85rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--laterite);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brandmark">
      Orivia Diamonds
    </div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#catalogue">Diamonds</a></li>
        <li><a href="#origin">Origin</a></li>
        <li><a href="#grading">Standards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#trade">Trade</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn" href="#trade">Inquire</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="rule"></span><span class="label">Orivia Minerals &nbsp;·&nbsp; Diamond Division</span></div>
      <h1>African soil.<br><em>Light of the Earth.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Orivia Diamonds sources, evaluates and trades natural, untreated diamonds directly from licensed surface mines across Sub-Saharan Africa. Rough parcels and polished diamonds, each traceable from the mine to your doorstep.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#catalogue">View current parcels</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#origin">Our chain of custody</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/images/hero-diamond.png" alt="" loading="eager">
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="ledger">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">01</div>
      <h3>KP &amp; Digital Traceability</h3>
      <p>Every parcel ships under Kimberley Process certification with a full digital chain-of-custody record.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <h3>Sub-Saharan Africa, Direct</h3>
      <p>Purchased directly at the point of extraction from licensed ASM mining sites.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">03</div>
      <h3>Long-Term Partnerships</h3>
      <p>Long-standing relationships with mining communities and stakeholders, experience built on repeat trade.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger-item">
      <div class="num">04</div>
      <h3>Compliance First</h3>
      <p>Held accountable to the full range of international and national standards governing responsible mining and diamond trade.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="catalogue">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Rough and polished,<br>same high standard.</h2>
      <span class="label">Current parcels</span>
    </div>
    <div class="catalogue">
      <div class="cat-card">
        <span class="label">Rough · Available</span>
        <h3>Rough Diamond Parcels</h3>
        <p>Natural, untreated diamonds, sold by parcel and digitally pre-evaluated to your planning specifications before you receive the goods.</p>
        <div class="cat-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 140" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none">
            <line x1="80" y1="54" x2="135" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.5"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="54" x2="25" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.5"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="10" x2="80" y2="54" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.5"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="130" x2="80" y2="54" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.5"/>
            <line x1="25" y1="68" x2="80" y2="82" stroke="var(--laterite)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <line x1="135" y1="68" x2="80" y2="82" stroke="var(--laterite)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="10" x2="25" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="10" x2="135" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="10" x2="80" y2="82" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="130" x2="25" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="130" x2="135" y2="68" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="80" y1="130" x2="80" y2="82" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <dl class="spec-list">
          <div class="spec"><dt>Parcel size</dt><dd>500 – 2,000 ct</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Origin</dt><dd>SUB-SAHARAN AFRICA</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Trade form</dt><dd>ALL</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Certification</dt><dd>KP + DIGITAL TRACEABILITY</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('parcel-modal').showModal()">View current parcel</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cat-card">
        <span class="label">Polished · Available</span>
        <h3>Cut &amp; Polished Diamonds</h3>
        <p>Polished diamonds, faceted to your specification, delivered with complete documentation and certification.</p>
        <div class="cat-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none">
            <circle cx="80" cy="80" r="62" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.8"/>
            <polygon points="104,80 97,97 80,104 63,97 56,80 63,63 80,56 97,63" stroke="var(--laterite)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <path d="M104,80 L119,96 M104,80 L119,64 M97,97 L96,119 M97,97 L119,96 M80,104 L64,119 M80,104 L96,119 M63,97 L41,96 M63,97 L64,119 M56,80 L41,64 M56,80 L41,96 M63,63 L64,41 M63,63 L41,64 M80,56 L96,41 M80,56 L64,41 M97,63 L119,64 M97,63 L96,41" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.6"/>
            <path d="M119,96 L142,80 M119,64 L142,80 M96,119 L124,124 M119,96 L124,124 M64,119 L80,142 M96,119 L80,142 M41,96 L36,124 M64,119 L36,124 M41,64 L18,80 M41,96 L18,80 M64,41 L36,36 M41,64 L36,36 M96,41 L80,18 M64,41 L80,18 M119,64 L124,36 M96,41 L124,36" stroke="var(--facet)" stroke-width="0.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <dl class="spec-list">
          <div class="spec"><dt>Carat range</dt><dd>0.30 – 20.00 CT</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Cut</dt><dd>ROUND &amp; FANCY</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Grading</dt><dd>GIA-ALIGNED 4Cs</dd></div>
          <div class="spec"><dt>Delivery</dt><dd>INSURED, TO YOUR LOCATION</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="btn" href="#trade">Request diamond list</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="origin" class="origin">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>From African soil<br>to your doorstep.</h2>
      <span class="label">Chain of custody</span>
    </div>
    <div class="origin-grid">
      <div class="origin-copy">
        <p>Orivia Minerals has traded minerals out of Sub-Saharan Africa for several years. Orivia Diamonds extends that same rigour to diamond mines across the continent, so every carat we trade can be traced back to a licensed mine of known origin.</p>
        <p>We work directly with mining communities, purchasing directly at the point of extraction. Our relationships with these communities are built for years, across seasons and parcels. We share friendships and the same values.</p>
        <p class="aside">In the regions where we operate, diamonds are known as: <em>Light of the Earth.</em></p>
      </div>
      <ol class="chain">
        <li><h4>Community partnership</h4><p>Long-term, direct relationships with mining cooperatives, built on repeat trade.</p></li>
        <li><h4>Licensed extraction</h4><p>Diamonds are purchased directly from licensed mining sites across our Sub-Saharan sourcing network.</p></li>
        <li><h4>Digital pre-evaluation</h4><p>Each parcel is weighed, scanned and mapped on-site by Orivia's resident gemologists before it is offered.</p></li>
        <li><h4>Kimberley certification</h4><p>Export documentation and digital chain-of-custody records are filed in-country before any parcel leaves the continent.</p></li>
        <li><h4>Cutting to specification</h4><p>Rough selected for polishing is planned and cut to the buyer's required characteristics; the remainder is sold on as graded rough parcels.</p></li>
        <li><h4>Sale &amp; delivery</h4><p>Diamonds ship insured, with full documentation, to the buyer's chosen location.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="grading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Evaluated to<br>your specification.</h2>
      <span class="label">Digital pre-evaluation, parcel by parcel</span>
    </div>
    <p class="section-intro">Before a parcel is delivered, every rough diamond is mapped with digital planning and optical scanning technology, plotting inclusions, projecting colour and simulating polished yield against the planning specification you set. We evaluate every parcel to your own standard and plan each diamond to the characteristics your order calls for.</p>
    <div class="grading">
      <div class="grade-card">
        <div class="letter">C</div>
        <h4>Carat</h4>
        <p>Weighed to 1/100 ct at the point of purchase, rough and polished, against your required weight range.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grade-card">
        <div class="letter">C</div>
        <h4>Cut</h4>
        <p>Rough is planned for maximum yield or to the shape you order.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grade-card">
        <div class="letter">C</div>
        <h4>Clarity</h4>
        <p>Mapped under magnification and digital scanning, then matched against the clarity band your specification calls for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grade-card">
        <div class="letter">C</div>
        <h4>Colour</h4>
        <p>Graded on the GIA D–Z and fancy scale, including fluorescence response.</p>
